==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[leave]] (someone) [[high and dry]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[abandon]] somebody; to stop providing [[assistance]] at a crucial moment.
#: ''He just walked out and '''left her high and dry''' with two kids and a mortgage.''

